# Migrations skipped by the local installer, with reasons.
#
# The product migrations under supabase/migrations remain authoritative for
# SCHEMA. A small number of historical migrations are DATA edits made against
# one specific hosted property (hard-coded row UUIDs that only exist there).
# A clean standalone installation has no such rows, so those migrations are
# not applicable — they are recorded in the ledger as skipped-by-policy rather
# than silently ignored.
#
# Format: <filename>  # <reason>
# Only data-only migrations may be listed here. Never skip a schema migration.

20260721144859_b10a8bc5-70f4-451d-9560-c7a3011c4128.sql  # property-specific room unit data (hard-coded room UUIDs)
20260806142337_0c977466-741b-4cd6-bc22-892f03edb5bd.sql  # demo/test booking data for one hosted property